OL,3,ASir Jim Ratcliffe's Ineos to mothball
OL,4,Athree major chemical sites in Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FBillionaire Sir Jim Ratcliffe's
OL,7,Findustrial giant Ineos is pausing
OL,8,Fproduction at its three sites in Hull,
OL,9,Fblaming high UK gas prices.
OL,11,FIneos has confirmed up to 4,000 jobs
OL,12,Fare affected `1,000 directly and
OL,13,Fanother 3,000 in the supply chain.
OL,15,FThe firm said gas prices in the UK are
OL,16,Ftwelve times higher than in the US, and
OL,17,Feight times more expensive than the
OL,18,Fcoal-based processes used by Chinese
OL,19,Fcompetitors.
