OL,3,ASir Jim Ratcliffe's Ineos to mothball
OL,4,Athree major chemical sites in Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Jim said: "We are being forced to
OL,7,Fmothball some of the most efficient
OL,8,Fplants in Europe, but with gas prices
OL,9,Fnow 12 times the level in the US and 8
OL,10,Ftimes that of China, we just cannot
OL,11,Fcompete."
